WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.538
Read another language. Keep the original.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.608
Meet Yuedu Translate. One click puts a translation
right under each paragraph.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.088
Read side by side, and check the details without
switching tabs.

4
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:21.724
See an unfamiliar word? Select it and look up its
translation, right on the page.

5
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.991
Choose the sites you want to translate automatically.
You're always in control.

6
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.773
Pick your target language from a searchable list.

7
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.776
Want the original view? Restore it in one click.

8
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:45.000
Yuedu Translate. Keep reading, keep understanding. Find
it on the Chrome Web Store.
